    'tm.role':         'Promotion Coordinator 100% &middot; Zurich Oerlikon',
    'tm.heading':      'Letter of Motivation',
    'tm.salutation':   'Dear Tiny Miracles Team',
    'tm.p1':           'When 40,000 people are standing in a field and the evening runs, someone kept a list for weeks beforehand. I know that role &ndash; I have held it at more than ten Swiss music festivals over the past year and a half.',
    'tm.p2':           'At TIT-PIT I am responsible for Migros brand experiences at festivals such as <strong>Frauenfeld</strong>, <strong>Pal&eacute;o</strong>, <strong>Gampel</strong>, <strong>Heitere</strong>, <strong>Moon &amp; Stars</strong> and <strong>Summerdays</strong> &ndash; from the first briefing through quoting and concept to on-site execution. I coordinate teams, hold timings, look after clients and stand on the ground at six in the morning on build day. What your ad lists under coordination, volunteers and presence at shows is my everyday work.',
    'tm.p3':           'The second half of this role is language. German and English are both mother tongues for me &ndash; my mother is American. At TIT-PIT I own social media content and client communication. Writing and editing press releases, newsletters, show announcements and presale landing pages in both languages is not an add-on for me &ndash; it is the part of the work I enjoy most.',
    'tm.p4':           'Why Tiny Miracles? Because behind TAKK ab Entertainment are the shows people keep an evening free for a year in advance. I come from music, I play guitar, I have spent years on festival grounds &ndash; and I know how much invisible coordination sits between an announcement post and the moment the lights go down. Working in that environment is not a job change for me, it is the logical next step.',
    'tm.p5':           'The role as central coordination point between CEO, Promotion Manager and team suits me. I work in a structured way, take ownership without a second loop of questions, and stay calm when something goes sideways two hours before doors. I welcome feedback &ndash; and I give it just as readily.',
    'tm.p6':           'One point where I want to be honest: I do not bring French. Everything else in your requirements profile I do bring &ndash; and I would take French on if the role calls for it.',
    'tm.closing':      'I look forward to meeting you.<br>Shayna Jucker',
    'tm.match-heading':'match',
    'tm.match-sub':    'Your job ad, point by point',
