    /* --- Hallo (general application) --- */
    'app.heading':     'Hello.',
    'app.lead':        'I build brand experiences that work beyond the day of the event.',
    'app.p1':          'I am Shayna Jucker, 28, based in Pf&auml;ffikon ZH. At TIT-PIT I am responsible for Migros brand experiences at more than ten Swiss music festivals and twelve stops of the Mocktail Bar Tour &ndash; from the first briefing to the final report with metrics.',
    'app.p2':          'I started somewhere else: five years as an architectural drafter, then a degree in Multimedia Production with a specialisation in Live Communication. That combination explains how I work. I read a stand plan like a drafter, think the brand like a strategist and know from practice what holds up on site.',
    'app.p3':          'This page is not an application for one specific job. It shows what people hire me for &ndash; and how I work when things get tight.',
    'app.roles-heading':'roles',
    'app.roles-sub':   'What people hire me for',
    'app.label-proof': 'Evidence',
    'app.label-role':  'My Role',
    'app.label-actions':'In practice',
    'app.r1-title':    'Brand Experience &amp; Live Events',
    'app.r1-sub':      'Brand appearances that work on site and live on afterwards',
    'app.r1-proof':    '10+ major Swiss festivals per year for Migros: Frauenfeld, Pal&eacute;o, Gampel, Heitere, Moon &amp; Stars, Stars in Town, Lumnezia, Luzern Live, Seaside, Summerdays and Summerstage.',
    'app.r1-role':     'Project Manager | Marketing, Events &amp; Brand Experience, TIT-PIT GmbH &ndash; with full client ownership.',
    'app.r1-a1':       'Concepts and quotes for activations, aligned directly with the client',
    'app.r1-a2':       'Coordinating suppliers, build teams and crews',
    'app.r1-a3':       'Merci Bus Tour for the 100th anniversary of Migros (2025)',
    'app.r1-a4':       'Lead on the Mocktail Bar Tour 2026',
    'app.r1-a5':       'On-site project leadership: build-up, operation, teardown, quality assurance',
    'app.r2-title':    'Campaigns, Content &amp; Communication',
    'app.r2-sub':      'Copy, image and channel so the brand is stronger afterwards than before',
    'app.r2-proof':    'German and English mother tongue. Radio reporter at Radio S&uuml;dostschweiz, social media and graphic design at TIT-PIT, multimedia design at fliggs mobile.',
    'app.r2-role':     'Responsible for content, design and client communication &ndash; from the idea to the published piece.',
    'app.r2-a1':       'Social media content and editorial planning around live formats',
    'app.r2-a2':       'Design and layout with Adobe Creative Suite, Figma and Canva',
    'app.r2-a3':       'Client communication and a consistent brand voice across all touchpoints',
    'app.r2-a4':       'Research, production and presenting on radio',
    'app.r2-a5':       'Bachelor thesis on brand activism at ON, Nike and Adidas',
    'app.r3-title':    'Project Management &amp; Coordination',
    'app.r3-sub':      'The place in the team where information comes together',
    'app.r3-proof':    'In project ownership roles continuously since 2020 &ndash; first in architecture, today in live marketing.',
    'app.r3-role':     'Interface between client, creation, production and crew. Decide, prioritise, follow up.',
    'app.r3-a1':       'Full client ownership from briefing to final report',
    'app.r3-a2':       'Budget responsibility and quoting',
    'app.r3-a3':       'Leading cross-functional teams, including without formal authority',
    'app.r3-a4':       'Scheduling and sequencing across several parallel projects',
    'app.r3-a5':       'Trusted with independent project leadership within 1.5 years',
    'app.how-heading': 'principles',
    'app.how-sub':     'How I work',
    'app.h1-label':    'Understand first, promise second',
    'app.h1-text':     'I would rather tell a client in the briefing that something will not work than on build day. It takes courage once and saves money three times.',
    'app.h2-label':    'The event is not the goal',
    'app.h2-text':     'An appearance only works for me when it lives on beyond the moment. That is why I plan content in from the start, not as an afterthought.',
    'app.h3-label':    'Staying calm is a skill',
    'app.h3-text':     'Two hours before doors, something regularly goes sideways. Whoever sets priorities then instead of debating saves the evening.',
    'app.h4-label':    'Being able to read plans helps',
    'app.h4-text':     'Five years of architecture mean I can tell from a stand plan whether an idea can be built &ndash; before anyone quotes it.',
    'app.facts-label': 'In numbers',
    'app.fact1':       '10+ major Swiss festivals per year under my own responsibility',
