    'mg.role':             'Sponsoring Manager / Brand Activation Manager &middot; Migros',
    'mg.salutation':       'Dear Migros sponsoring team',
    'mg.p1':               'You may already know me, just from the other side of the table. For more than a year and a half I have been delivering Migros&rsquo; festival presence at TIT-PIT &ndash; at more than ten of Switzerland&rsquo;s biggest festivals, from <strong>Frauenfeld</strong> to <strong>Pal&eacute;o</strong>, <strong>Gampel</strong> and <strong>Moon &amp; Stars</strong>, and in 2026 also with twelve stops of the <strong>Mocktail Bar Tour</strong>.',
    'mg.p2':               'So I know fairly precisely where a Migros presence wins on site and where it loses: at the queue, with the weather, at the moment the crew no longer knows why it is there. And I know that at festivals the brand embodies something nobody else there has &ndash; everyday life, region, fair prices.',
    'mg.p3':               'I turned that into a work sample: <strong>&ldquo;Long Table&rdquo;</strong>. A table with products from the local cooperative where you finally sit down at a festival &ndash; and a season planner that calculates live how many guests a table reaches, what a guest costs and whether the season covers all regions or only the big cities. Everything in it is invented and is not based on information from my previous projects.',
    'mg.p4':               'I want to take the step from delivery to steering: no longer just executing sponsorship, but helping to decide which engagements Migros enters, how they are activated and how their success is measured. Someone who knows execution as well as I do plans concepts that hold up on site.',
    'mg.p5':               'And because I know how many people work on a single presence, one thing matters to me: a good briefing is the biggest gift you can give an agency. I would like to be the one who writes it.',
    'mg.closing':          'I look forward to telling you the rest in person.<br>Kind regards<br>Shayna Jucker',
    'mg.sample-p1':        '<strong>&ldquo;Long Table&rdquo; &ndash; a chair is the biggest gift at a festival.</strong> A table with products from the local cooperative, labelled with their origin, at a fair price. No free food, no lounge, no prize draw &ndash; but a place where you sit and get talking to strangers.',
    'mg.sample-p2':        'Plus a season planner: pick festivals, size the table, set the share of visitors. It calculates guests, cost per guest and crew days, shows per region who is reached &ndash; and says in one sentence whether the table is too small, too big or too urban.',
    'mg.sample-p3':        'Festivals, figures and targets are invented. This is not official Migros material and is based on no internal information. What is real is the planning logic and the measurement plan. Bilingual German and English.',
    'mg.sample-btn':       'Open the season planner',
    'mg.m1-label':         'Knowing Migros from the inside',
    'mg.m1-text':          'A year and a half of festival presence for Migros and its subsidiaries. I know the processes, the contacts and the expectations &ndash; from the agency&rsquo;s point of view.',
    'mg.m2-label':         'Activating sponsorship',
    'mg.m2-text':          'From concept through stand plan, suppliers and crew to dismantling. I know what a sponsorship right is worth on site and what it takes to make it work.',
    'mg.m3-label':         'Major events across Switzerland',
    'mg.m3-text':          'More than ten festivals a year in German- and French-speaking Switzerland, plus twelve stops of the Mocktail Bar Tour. I know the organiser&rsquo;s side and the routes across the site.',
    'mg.m4-label':         'Briefing and steering agencies',
    'mg.m4-text':          'I know both sides of the briefing. From the agency I know what a good briefing triggers, where buffers hide and how to get productions through cleanly.',
    'mg.m5-label':         'KPIs and post-event reports',
    'mg.m5-text':          'Post-event reports with metrics are standard for me. Every number gets a measurement path and a target before the festival starts.',
    'mg.m6-label':         'Owning the budget',
    'mg.m6-text':          'Full budget responsibility per project, quotes and post-calculation. I go into budget talks with variants and the difference between them.',
    'mg.m7-label':         'Content and communication',
    'mg.m7-text':          'Social media content around every presence. I do photo, video, editing and copy myself &ndash; so that a festival presence does not end on Sunday evening.',
    'mg.m8-label':         'Designing myself',
    'mg.m8-text':          'Adobe Creative Cloud daily, plus Figma and Canva. I do not need an agency for a concept mock-up or a stand sketch.',
    'mg.fact1':            'Available from November 2026',
    'mg.fact2':            'Living in Pf&auml;ffikon ZH &ndash; about 30 minutes to Zurich',
    'mg.fact3':            'German and English native &ndash; I do not bring French or Italian at working level',
    'mg.fact4':            'Currently at an agency that works for Migros &ndash; a move would need to be agreed cleanly with both sides',
    'mg.fact5':            'So far delivery and project management, not yet responsibility for an entire sponsorship portfolio',
    'mg.fact6':            'BSc Multimedia Production FHGR, specialisation in live communication, exchange semester in the Netherlands',
    'mg.fact7':            'Draughtswoman EFZ in architecture &ndash; five years of final artwork and dimensional accuracy',
    'mg.heading':          'Letter of motivation',
    'mg.cert-heading':     'Documents',
    'mg.cert-sub':         'CV, REFERENCES &amp; ACADEMIC RECORDS',
    'mg.cv-btn':           'CV',
    'mg.cert-btn':         'References &amp; academic records',
    'mg.contact-cta':      'Questions? I am reachable directly.',
    'mg.btn-mail':         'Write me',
    'mg.sample-heading':   'Work sample',
    'mg.sample-sub':       'Instead of a claim: the work itself',
    'mg.match-heading':    'Fit',
    'mg.match-sub':        'The role, point by point',
    'mg.facts-label':      'Key facts &ndash; including the awkward ones',
    'mg.skills-heading':   'Skills',
    'mg.skills-sub':       'Management &middot; Events &middot; Marketing &middot; Design &middot; Tools &middot; Architecture',
