    'zu.role':             'Sponsorship &amp; Brand Experience Manager &middot; Zurich Insurance',
    'zu.salutation':       'Dear Zurich sponsorship team',
    'zu.p1':               'The best experience with an insurer is the one you never have. For sponsorship that is a strange starting point &ndash; and that is exactly why it is an exciting one: an insurance brand cannot shine at a sports event with a product. It can only shine with something it knows better than anyone else.',
    'zu.p2':               'That is where my work sample comes from: <strong>&ldquo;Before&rdquo;</strong>. Three stations at sports events, each sixty seconds long, each with one single tip &ndash; the blind spot at a lorry, the stairs, the basement. Plus a throughput planner that calculates hour by hour whether a queue forms. Because an experience with a queue is not an experience.',
    'zu.p3':               'At TIT-PIT I am responsible for Migros&rsquo; brand experiences at more than ten Swiss festivals &ndash; <strong>Frauenfeld</strong>, <strong>Pal&eacute;o</strong>, <strong>Gampel</strong>, <strong>Moon &amp; Stars</strong> &ndash; and in 2026 the twelve stops of the <strong>Mocktail Bar Tour</strong>. I know how many people a station really handles per hour, when a crew gets tired and how to measure after the weekend whether a presence was worth it.',
    'zu.p4':               'What draws me to Zurich is the link between brand and responsibility. Prevention is not an advertising promise but a real benefit &ndash; and sponsorship is where an insurer can put that benefit into people&rsquo;s hands before something happens. That is what I want to work on, no longer for an agency, but within the brand.',
    'zu.p5':               'My principle: every metric gets a measurement path and a target before the event starts. Anything you can only estimate does not belong in a report.',
    'zu.closing':          'I look forward to telling you the rest in person.<br>Kind regards<br>Shayna Jucker',
    'zu.sample-p1':        '<strong>&ldquo;Before&rdquo; &ndash; an insurer that shows up before something happens.</strong> Three stations at sports events: the blind spot at a lorry, stairs with one step too high, a basement with three weak spots. Each takes sixty seconds and ends with a tip. No sales talk, no data collection.',
    'zu.sample-p2':        'Plus a throughput planner: set visitors, share, runs and group size &ndash; it spreads demand across the day, draws the day curve against capacity and says whether a queue forms at the peak hour or the crew stands around.',
    'zu.sample-p3':        'Stations, figures and targets are invented. This is not official material of Zurich Insurance and is based on no internal information. What is real is the throughput calculation and the measurement plan. Bilingual German and English.',
    'zu.sample-btn':       'Open the throughput planner',
    'zu.m1-label':         'Activating sponsorship',
    'zu.m1-text':          'Overall lead of Migros&rsquo; sponsorship presence at major festivals and on the Mocktail Bar Tour &ndash; from concept through activation to the post-event report.',
    'zu.m2-label':         'Building brand experiences',
    'zu.m2-text':          'I plan experiences from the flow: who comes when, how long a run takes, where the queue forms. Only then do we talk about design.',
    'zu.m3-label':         'Major events in Switzerland',
    'zu.m3-text':          'More than twenty deployments a year at festivals and tours. I know the organiser&rsquo;s side, permits, safety concepts and the routes across the site.',
    'zu.m4-label':         'KPIs and ROI',
    'zu.m4-text':          'Post-event reports with metrics are standard. I would rather measure one uncomfortable number honestly than ten comfortable ones vaguely.',
    'zu.m5-label':         'Owning the budget',
    'zu.m5-text':          'Full budget responsibility per project, quotes, supplier contracts and post-calculation. Cost per person reached is not theory for me.',
    'zu.m6-label':         'Steering agencies and partners',
    'zu.m6-text':          'I know both sides of the briefing &ndash; and I know what a good briefing triggers and where buffers hide.',
    'zu.m7-label':         'Knowing sport from the inside',
    'zu.m7-text':          'Figure skating since childhood, plus snowboarding, skiing, football and surfing. I know what an event feels like from the audience&rsquo;s side.',
    'zu.m8-label':         'German and English',
    'zu.m8-text':          'Both native languages, my mother is American. I write concepts, briefings and reports in both languages at publication level.',
    'zu.fact1':            'Available from November 2026',
    'zu.fact2':            'Living in Pf&auml;ffikon ZH &ndash; about 30 minutes to Zurich',
    'zu.fact3':            'German and English native &ndash; I do not bring French or Italian at working level',
    'zu.fact4':            'No experience in the insurance industry &ndash; but plenty of experience with safety and processes at major events',
    'zu.fact5':            'So far on the agency side &ndash; in return I know the execution of every sponsorship right first-hand',
    'zu.fact6':            'BSc Multimedia Production FHGR, specialisation in live communication, exchange semester in the Netherlands',
    'zu.fact7':            'Draughtswoman EFZ in architecture &ndash; five years of final artwork and dimensional accuracy',
    'zu.heading':          'Letter of motivation',
    'zu.cert-heading':     'Documents',
    'zu.cert-sub':         'CV, REFERENCES &amp; ACADEMIC RECORDS',
    'zu.cv-btn':           'CV',
    'zu.cert-btn':         'References &amp; academic records',
    'zu.contact-cta':      'Questions? I am reachable directly.',
    'zu.btn-mail':         'Write me',
    'zu.sample-heading':   'Work sample',
    'zu.sample-sub':       'Instead of a claim: the work itself',
    'zu.match-heading':    'Fit',
    'zu.match-sub':        'The role, point by point',
    'zu.facts-label':      'Key facts &ndash; including the awkward ones',
    'zu.skills-heading':   'Skills',
    'zu.skills-sub':       'Management &middot; Events &middot; Marketing &middot; Design &middot; Tools &middot; Architecture',
