    'az.role':             'Sponsoring &amp; Event Manager &middot; Allianz Suisse',
    'az.salutation':       'Dear Allianz Suisse sponsoring and events team',
    'az.p1':               'An open-air cinema carrying an insurer&rsquo;s name faces a special test: not the beautiful summer evening, but the one when it starts raining at half past four. That evening shows whether someone planned ahead &ndash; and that is exactly the promise of an insurer.',
    'az.p2':               'That is why my work sample is not an advertising presence but a <strong>&ldquo;rain plan&rdquo;</strong>: a fixed decision at 4 pm, three prepared variants and a tool that turns forecast and presales into a recommendation &ndash; including the messages that then go out to the audience. Because at outdoor events it is not the idea that decides, but the preparation.',
    'az.p3':               'At TIT-PIT I am responsible for Migros&rsquo; presence at more than ten Swiss open-air festivals &ndash; <strong>Frauenfeld</strong>, <strong>Pal&eacute;o</strong>, <strong>Gampel</strong>, <strong>Moon &amp; Stars</strong>, <strong>Summerdays</strong> &ndash; and in 2026 the twelve stops of the <strong>Mocktail Bar Tour</strong>. Rain, wind, permits, suppliers and crews are my daily work. I know what it means to make a decision at 4 pm that affects a thousand people.',
    'az.p4':               'What draws me to Allianz Suisse is the closeness between brand and event. When an insurer gives a cinema its name, every evening becomes a small proof of how it treats its audience. I want to plan and own those evenings &ndash; no longer for an agency, but within the brand.',
    'az.p5':               'My principle: prepare decisions while things are calm. Then under stress they only need to be carried out.',
    'az.closing':          'I look forward to telling you the rest in person.<br>Kind regards<br>Shayna Jucker',
    'az.sample-p1':        '<strong>&ldquo;Rain plan&rdquo; &ndash; the evening the brand is tested.</strong> An open-air cinema with a fixed decision at 4 pm and three prepared variants: play, play with rain kit, postpone. Each with its own process, its own message and its own budget.',
    'az.sample-p2':        'Plus a tool: enter the probability of rain, wind gusts and presales &ndash; it calculates guests, costs and cost per guest for each variant, recommends one and shows the messages to the audience. From 50 km/h of wind it does not calculate, it postpones.',
    'az.sample-p3':        'Variants, costs and rates are invented. This is not official Allianz Suisse material and is based on no internal information. What is real is the approach. Bilingual German and English.',
    'az.sample-btn':       'Open the rain plan',
    'az.m1-label':         'Running open-air events',
    'az.m1-text':          'More than ten outdoor festivals a year. Weather, wind, permits and safety concepts are routine for me, not the exception.',
    'az.m2-label':         'Activating sponsorship',
    'az.m2-text':          'Overall lead of Migros&rsquo; sponsorship presence &ndash; from concept through stand plan, suppliers and crew to the post-event report.',
    'az.m3-label':         'Guests and communication',
    'az.m3-text':          'Guest lists, accreditation and customer communication around every event. I know that one clear message at 4 pm is worth more than three vague ones.',
    'az.m4-label':         'Owning the budget',
    'az.m4-text':          'Full budget responsibility per project, quotes, supplier contracts and post-calculation &ndash; including variants for when things turn out differently.',
    'az.m5-label':         'KPIs and post-event reports',
    'az.m5-text':          'Post-event reports with metrics are standard for me. Every number has a measurement path before the event starts.',
    'az.m6-label':         'Steering partners and agencies',
    'az.m6-text':          'Translating between clients, organisers, technology, catering and crews is my daily work. Project management since 2020.',
    'az.m7-label':         'Content and social media',
    'az.m7-text':          'I do photo, video, editing and copy myself &ndash; so that a cinema evening does not end at midnight but lives on online.',
    'az.m8-label':         'German and English',
    'az.m8-text':          'Both native languages, my mother is American. I write concepts, briefings and copy in both languages at publication level.',
    'az.fact1':            'Available from November 2026',
    'az.fact2':            'Living in Pf&auml;ffikon ZH &ndash; about 20 minutes to Wallisellen',
    'az.fact3':            'German and English native &ndash; I do not bring French or Italian at working level',
    'az.fact4':            'No experience in the insurance industry &ndash; but plenty of experience with risks and plan B at major events',
    'az.fact5':            'So far on the agency side &ndash; in return I know the execution of every sponsorship right first-hand',
    'az.fact6':            'BSc Multimedia Production FHGR, specialisation in live communication, exchange semester in the Netherlands',
    'az.fact7':            'Draughtswoman EFZ in architecture &ndash; five years of final artwork and dimensional accuracy',
    'az.heading':          'Letter of motivation',
    'az.cert-heading':     'Documents',
    'az.cert-sub':         'CV, REFERENCES &amp; ACADEMIC RECORDS',
    'az.cv-btn':           'CV',
    'az.cert-btn':         'References &amp; academic records',
    'az.contact-cta':      'Questions? I am reachable directly.',
    'az.btn-mail':         'Write me',
    'az.sample-heading':   'Work sample',
    'az.sample-sub':       'Instead of a claim: the work itself',
    'az.match-heading':    'Fit',
    'az.match-sub':        'The role, point by point',
    'az.facts-label':      'Key facts &ndash; including the awkward ones',
    'az.skills-heading':   'Skills',
    'az.skills-sub':       'Management &middot; Events &middot; Marketing &middot; Design &middot; Tools &middot; Architecture',
