    'sp.role':             'Project Manager Events &amp; Sponsoring &middot; Confiserie Spr&uuml;ngli',
    'sp.salutation':       'Dear Confiserie Spr&uuml;ngli marketing team',
    'sp.p1':               'A confectioner has no event season. It has a year in which Easter, Mother&rsquo;s Day and Advent belong to sales &ndash; and, in between, weeks in which a house like yours can show what happens behind the counter. Finding those weeks and filling them well is, to me, the real job of a project manager for events and sponsoring.',
    'sp.p2':               'That is why my work sample is not a single idea but a plan: <strong>&ldquo;A year on Paradeplatz&rdquo;</strong>. Nine invented formats over twelve months &ndash; from a New Year tasting to an autumn workshop in the bakery &ndash; and a calendar that shows whether the team can carry them alongside sales. Schedule an event in December and you immediately see who will be missing in the shop.',
    'sp.p3':               'At TIT-PIT I am responsible for Migros&rsquo; brand experiences at more than ten Swiss festivals and, in 2026, the twelve stops of the <strong>Mocktail Bar Tour</strong>. That includes guest lists, suppliers, permits, materials, crews and the moment an idea meets a real space with real people. I enjoy planning with attention to detail &ndash; my first training as a draughtswoman in architecture taught me that a millimetre counts.',
    'sp.p4':               'What draws me to Spr&uuml;ngli is the link between craft, tradition and city. A house that has stood on Paradeplatz for generations does not need loud appearances. It needs events made as carefully as the products &ndash; and partnerships that suit the city and the people who shop here.',
    'sp.p5':               'My principle: the most important date in the event calendar is the one you deliberately keep free.',
    'sp.closing':          'I look forward to telling you the rest in person.<br>Kind regards<br>Shayna Jucker',
    'sp.sample-p1':        '<strong>&ldquo;A year on Paradeplatz&rdquo; &ndash; an event and sponsorship calendar.</strong> Nine invented formats that show craft instead of advertising, stay small enough for every guest to talk to a confectioner, and leave the house only where a partner truly fits.',
    'sp.sample-p2':        'Plus an interactive calendar: switch formats on and off and it shows, month by month, the team hours needed against the hours free alongside sales. Where an event takes people away from the shop it turns red &ndash; and the tool says what to do.',
    'sp.sample-p3':        'Formats, hours and budgets are invented. This is not official material of Confiserie Spr&uuml;ngli and is based on no internal information. What is real is the planning logic. Bilingual German and English.',
    'sp.sample-btn':       'Open the annual calendar',
    'sp.m1-label':         'Events from A to Z',
    'sp.m1-text':          'More than twenty deployments a year, from concept through guest lists, suppliers and materials to dismantling and the post-event report.',
    'sp.m2-label':         'Managing sponsorship',
    'sp.m2-text':          'Overall lead of Migros&rsquo; sponsorship presence at major festivals. I know what a partner expects and what a presence on site needs to work.',
    'sp.m3-label':         'Attention to detail',
    'sp.m3-text':          'Five years as a draughtswoman in architecture: final artwork, dimensional accuracy, plans that have to be right. I bring that precision to every project.',
    'sp.m4-label':         'Planning with sales',
    'sp.m4-text':          'I plan events around the core business, not against it. My calendar shows how &ndash; month by month, with team hours instead of a wish list.',
    'sp.m5-label':         'Budget and post-calculation',
    'sp.m5-text':          'Budget responsibility per project, quotes, supplier contracts and post-calculation. Cost per guest is not theory for me.',
    'sp.m6-label':         'Content and communication',
    'sp.m6-text':          'I do invitations, social media, photo and video myself &ndash; so that an event is not only visible to the guests on site.',
    'sp.m7-label':         'Designing myself',
    'sp.m7-text':          'Adobe Creative Cloud daily: InDesign, Illustrator, Photoshop, Premiere Pro. I do not need an agency for an invitation or a table concept.',
    'sp.m8-label':         'German and English',
    'sp.m8-text':          'Both native languages, my mother is American &ndash; useful for an international clientele on Paradeplatz.',
    'sp.fact1':            'Available from November 2026',
    'sp.fact2':            'Living in Pf&auml;ffikon ZH &ndash; about 30 minutes to Paradeplatz',
    'sp.fact3':            'German and English native &ndash; I do not bring French or Italian at working level',
    'sp.fact4':            'No experience in retail or confectionery &ndash; but experience with food and drink presences at major events',
    'sp.fact5':            'So far mostly large events &ndash; small, very personal formats would be a deliberate step for me',
    'sp.fact6':            'BSc Multimedia Production FHGR, specialisation in live communication, exchange semester in the Netherlands',
    'sp.fact7':            'Draughtswoman EFZ in architecture &ndash; five years of final artwork and dimensional accuracy',
    'sp.heading':          'Letter of motivation',
    'sp.cert-heading':     'Documents',
    'sp.cert-sub':         'CV, REFERENCES &amp; ACADEMIC RECORDS',
    'sp.cv-btn':           'CV',
    'sp.cert-btn':         'References &amp; academic records',
    'sp.contact-cta':      'Questions? I am reachable directly.',
    'sp.btn-mail':         'Write me',
    'sp.sample-heading':   'Work sample',
    'sp.sample-sub':       'Instead of a claim: the work itself',
    'sp.match-heading':    'Fit',
    'sp.match-sub':        'The role, point by point',
    'sp.facts-label':      'Key facts &ndash; including the awkward ones',
    'sp.skills-heading':   'Skills',
    'sp.skills-sub':       'Management &middot; Events &middot; Marketing &middot; Design &middot; Tools &middot; Architecture',
