    'rg.role':             'Brand Partnerships Manager &middot; Ringier',
    'rg.salutation':       'Dear Ringier brand partnerships team',
    'rg.p1':               'A brand partnership with a media house sells two things: reach and credibility. Reach is in the offer. Credibility is not &ndash; even though it is the real reason a brand does not simply buy ads but enters a partnership with you.',
    'rg.p2':               'That is why my work sample is a <strong>package configurator</strong> that calculates both together: <strong>&ldquo;Paid, but honest&rdquo;</strong>. Six invented formats from news portal to live talk, duration, price, reach and CPM &ndash; and a four-step ladder that sets how a piece is labelled depending on how much say the partner has. The configurator even shows what the piece will look like to readers.',
    'rg.p3':               'At TIT-PIT I am responsible for Migros&rsquo; brand experiences at more than ten Swiss festivals and, in 2026, the twelve stops of the <strong>Mocktail Bar Tour</strong>. I work every day where a brand meets an audience it did not invite &ndash; and I know how quickly that audience notices when something is not meant honestly. I also make content myself: photo, video, editing and copy.',
    'rg.p4':               'What draws me to Ringier is the breadth: news, magazines, video, podcasts and own events under one roof. For partners that means a story can be told across several channels. For me it means building packages that work for brands and remain acceptable for the titles.',
    'rg.p5':               'My principle: reach gladly, credibility never. The label is fixed before the offer, not after approval.',
    'rg.closing':          'I look forward to telling you the rest in person.<br>Kind regards<br>Shayna Jucker',
    'rg.sample-p1':        '<strong>&ldquo;Paid, but honest&rdquo; &ndash; a package configurator for brand partnerships.</strong> Combine six invented formats freely, choose the duration and set how much say the partner has in the content. It calculates price, contacts and CPM and shows reach per format.',
    'rg.sample-p2':        'The most important part is the ladder: the more say, the clearer the label &ndash; from &ldquo;Presented by&rdquo; to &ldquo;Paid post&rdquo;. A preview shows how the piece appears labelled, and the tool warns when a label does not fit the format.',
    'rg.sample-p3':        'Formats, prices and reach are invented. This is not official Ringier material and is based on no internal information. What is real is the attitude. Bilingual German and English.',
    'rg.sample-btn':       'Open the configurator',
    'rg.m1-label':         'Selling and managing partnerships',
    'rg.m1-text':          'I am used to talking to brands about objectives, budgets and metrics &ndash; and then delivering what was promised.',
    'rg.m2-label':         'Cross-media packages',
    'rg.m2-text':          'From live presence through social media to the post-event report: I think of partnerships across channels, not as a single placement.',
    'rg.m3-label':         'Making content myself',
    'rg.m3-text':          'I do photo, video, editing and copy myself. I know what a branded content brief needs so that something good comes out at the end.',
    'rg.m4-label':         'Events',
    'rg.m4-text':          'More than twenty deployments a year. If a package includes a live talk or a reader event, I know every step first-hand.',
    'rg.m5-label':         'KPIs and reporting',
    'rg.m5-text':          'Post-event reports with metrics are standard. I measure impact for the partner &ndash; and whether trust in the title holds.',
    'rg.m6-label':         'Budget and offer',
    'rg.m6-text':          'Quotes, calculation, post-calculation. I go into a conversation with variants and the difference between them.',
    'rg.m7-label':         'Understanding media',
    'rg.m7-text':          'Radio experience during my studies: features, vox pops, making-ofs. I know the difference between editorial and advertising from my own work.',
    'rg.m8-label':         'German and English',
    'rg.m8-text':          'Both native languages, my mother is American. I write and edit copy in both languages at publication level.',
    'rg.fact1':            'Available from November 2026',
    'rg.fact2':            'Living in Pf&auml;ffikon ZH &ndash; about 30 minutes to Zurich',
    'rg.fact3':            'German and English native &ndash; I do not bring French or Italian at working level',
    'rg.fact4':            'No experience in a media house&rsquo;s ad sales &ndash; but plenty of experience on the side of brands and their presence',
