    'tc.role':             'Partnership Manager &middot; Ticketcorner',
    'tc.salutation':       'Dear Ticketcorner partnership team',
    'tc.p1':               'A partner presale is a promise to two sides: to the brand, that its customers are worth it &ndash; and to everyone else, that they still have a fair chance. Whoever manages partnerships on a ticketing platform has to keep both promises at once. That is exactly what I find exciting about this role.',
    'tc.p2':               'That is why my work sample is a simulation: <strong>&ldquo;Presale window&rdquo;</strong>. An invented concert with 20,000 seats, a partner allocation, a time window and a demand you can move. Over ten days the curve shows when the concert sells out, how many seats go into general sale and who ends up empty-handed &ndash; and the tool says when an allocation becomes unfair or an empty promise.',
    'tc.p3':               'At TIT-PIT I am responsible for Migros&rsquo; presence at more than ten Swiss festivals &ndash; <strong>Frauenfeld</strong>, <strong>Pal&eacute;o</strong>, <strong>Gampel</strong>, <strong>Moon &amp; Stars</strong> &ndash; and in 2026 the twelve stops of the <strong>Mocktail Bar Tour</strong>. I know the live business from the organiser&rsquo;s side: partners, allocations, accreditation, guest lists and the moment thousands of people arrive at once.',
    'tc.p4':               'What draws me to Ticketcorner is its position between everyone: promoters, brands and audience. A partnership built well here works with every ticket sold &ndash; and a badly built one with every complaint. I want to build the first kind.',
    'tc.p5':               'My principle: the size of a partner allocation does not depend on the partner, but on demand.',
    'tc.closing':          'I look forward to telling you the rest in person.<br>Kind regards<br>Shayna Jucker',
    'tc.sample-p1':        '<strong>&ldquo;Presale window&rdquo; &ndash; a partner presale that stays fair.</strong> Two phases and one rule: the partner&rsquo;s customers buy with a code in a fixed window, the rest goes into general sale &ndash; and with very high demand at least 70% of seats stay freely available.',
    'tc.sample-p2':        'Plus a simulation: set allocation, demand, partner customers and window length. The curve shows tickets sold over ten days, the metrics show redemption, free share, sell-out time and who ends up empty-handed.',
    'tc.sample-p3':        'Concert, partner and figures are invented. This is not official Ticketcorner material and is based on no internal information. What is real is the attitude. Bilingual German and English.',
    'tc.sample-btn':       'Open the simulation',
    'tc.m1-label':         'Managing partnerships',
    'tc.m1-text':          'Overall lead of Migros&rsquo; sponsorship presence at festivals &ndash; objectives, budget, metrics and post-event report. I know what a partner expects.',
    'tc.m2-label':         'Knowing the live business',
    'tc.m2-text':          'More than twenty deployments a year at major festivals. Promoters, allocations, accreditation and admission are my daily work.',
    'tc.m3-label':         'Numbers and scenarios',
    'tc.m3-text':          'I go into conversations with variants, not with an opinion. My work sample shows how I calculate scenarios for partners.',
    'tc.m4-label':         'KPIs and reporting',
    'tc.m4-text':          'Post-event reports with metrics are standard. Every number has a measurement path &ndash; for the partner and for the audience.',
    'tc.m5-label':         'Campaigns and content',
    'tc.m5-text':          'Social media content and customer communication around every format. I do photo, video, editing and copy myself.',
    'tc.m6-label':         'Bringing stakeholders together',
    'tc.m6-text':          'Translating between brands, organisers, creative, production and crews is my daily work. Project management since 2020.',
    'tc.m7-label':         'Owning the budget',
    'tc.m7-text':          'Full budget responsibility per project, quotes, contracts and post-calculation.',
    'tc.m8-label':         'German and English',
    'tc.m8-text':          'Both native languages, my mother is American &ndash; useful with international tours and partners.',
    'tc.fact1':            'Available from November 2026',
    'tc.fact2':            'Living in Pf&auml;ffikon ZH &ndash; about 30 minutes to Zurich',
    'tc.fact3':            'German and English native &ndash; I do not bring French or Italian at working level',
    'tc.fact4':            'No experience at a ticketing platform &ndash; but plenty of experience on the organiser and brand side',
    'tc.fact5':            'So far on site rather than online &ndash; the platform perspective would be new to me, and that is exactly why it appeals',
    'tc.fact6':            'BSc Multimedia Production FHGR, specialisation in live communication, exchange semester in the Netherlands',
    'tc.fact7':            'Draughtswoman EFZ in architecture &ndash; five years of final artwork and dimensional accuracy',
    'tc.heading':          'Letter of motivation',
    'tc.cert-heading':     'Documents',
    'tc.cert-sub':         'CV, REFERENCES &amp; ACADEMIC RECORDS',
    'tc.cv-btn':           'CV',
    'tc.cert-btn':         'References &amp; academic records',
    'tc.contact-cta':      'Questions? I am reachable directly.',
    'tc.btn-mail':         'Write me',
    'tc.sample-heading':   'Work sample',
    'tc.sample-sub':       'Instead of a claim: the work itself',
    'tc.match-heading':    'Fit',
    'tc.match-sub':        'The role, point by point',
    'tc.facts-label':      'Key facts &ndash; including the awkward ones',
