    'mp.role':             'Sponsorship &amp; Business Development Manager &middot; via Michael Page &middot; Ref. JN-092026-7096210',
    'mp.salutation':       'Dear Sir or Madam',
    'mp.p1':               'You are looking for someone in Zurich to build and sell sponsorship for conferences on behalf of an international organisation. I bring the side of conference sponsorship that is often underestimated: I know what a sponsor expects on site, because for more than a year and a half I have been delivering exactly these presences for a major Swiss brand &ndash; and I know that a sponsorship programme is not decided in autumn, but in spring.',
    'mp.p2':               'So as a work sample I built a sponsorship prospectus with a pipeline calculator: <strong>&ldquo;Pipeline, not hope&rdquo;</strong>. Five clearly limited packages for an invented medical congress and a calculator that shows how many companies need to be approached to reach a revenue target &ndash; with a guardrail so that no single sponsor carries more than a quarter of revenue. In healthcare in particular, independence is part of the product.',
    'mp.p3':               'At TIT-PIT I am responsible for Migros&rsquo; sponsorship presence at more than ten Swiss festivals &ndash; <strong>Frauenfeld</strong>, <strong>Pal&eacute;o</strong>, <strong>Gampel</strong>, <strong>Moon &amp; Stars</strong> &ndash; and in 2026 the twelve stops of the <strong>Mocktail Bar Tour</strong>. Quotes, contracts, budgets, stand plans, suppliers and post-event reports with metrics are my daily work. Business development in the narrower sense would be my next step &ndash; one I have deliberately prepared for.',
    'mp.p4':               'I do not bring experience in the pharmaceutical industry, and I would rather say so myself than have you look for it. What I bring is the habit of quickly learning rules that are not negotiable &ndash; from permits at major events to safety concepts. I would treat industry codes and transparency rules the same way: as part of the offer, not as an obstacle.',
    'mp.p5':               'The interim arrangement with an option to be taken on suits me well: I am available from November 2026 and would use the first months to build the pipeline I can then be measured against.',
    'mp.closing':          'I look forward to hearing from you.<br>Kind regards<br>Shayna Jucker',
    'mp.sample-p1':        '<strong>&ldquo;Pipeline, not hope&rdquo; &ndash; sponsorship for a medical congress.</strong> A prospectus with five clearly limited packages, from platinum to exhibition, and an inventory that shows the most a congress can sell.',
    'mp.sample-p2':        'Plus a pipeline calculator: set companies, conversation rate, closing rate and sales focus. A funnel shows the four stages, the metrics show revenue, target reached, number of contracts and the share of the largest sponsor &ndash; and the tool says how many contacts are missing for the target.',
    'mp.sample-p3':        'Congress, packages and figures are invented. I do not know the client behind the job ad; this is not material of Michael Page or of any conference organisation. What is real is the approach. Bilingual German and English.',
    'mp.sample-btn':       'Open the pipeline calculator',
    'mp.m1-label':         'Understanding sponsorship',
    'mp.m1-text':          'Overall lead of Migros&rsquo; sponsorship presence at festivals. I know what a sponsor expects on site &ndash; and what it wants to see in the post-event report.',
    'mp.m2-label':         'Packages and offers',
    'mp.m2-text':          'Quotes, supplier contracts and calculation for more than twenty deployments a year. I build offers people can understand and compare.',
    'mp.m3-label':         'Pipeline and numbers',
    'mp.m3-text':          'I work with variants, rates and targets instead of gut feeling. My work sample shows how I calculate a sales pipeline.',
    'mp.m4-label':         'Conferences and events',
    'mp.m4-text':          'Major events from planning to dismantling: stand plans, exhibition space, accreditation, suppliers and crews.',
    'mp.m5-label':         'Taking rules seriously',
    'mp.m5-text':          'Permits, safety concepts and conditions are everyday business at major events. I would treat compliance the same way: as part of the offer.',
    'mp.m6-label':         'Working internationally',
    'mp.m6-text':          'German and English native, exchange semester in the Netherlands. I write concepts and offers in both languages at publication level.',
    'mp.m7-label':         'Managing stakeholders',
    'mp.m7-text':          'Translating between clients, organisers, creative, production and crews is my daily work. Project management since 2020.',
    'mp.m8-label':         'Designing myself',
    'mp.m8-text':          'Adobe Creative Cloud daily, plus Figma. I can design a sponsorship prospectus myself &ndash; the work sample is the proof.',
    'mp.fact1':            'Available from November 2026, interim with an option to be taken on suits me',
    'mp.fact2':            'Living in Pf&auml;ffikon ZH &ndash; about 30 minutes to Zurich',
    'mp.fact3':            'German and English native &ndash; I do not bring French or Italian at working level',
    'mp.fact4':            'No experience in the pharmaceutical industry and no classic business development &ndash; but plenty of experience with sponsors and their expectations',
    'mp.fact5':            'So far delivery and project management on the agency side',
    'mp.fact6':            'BSc Multimedia Production FHGR, specialisation in live communication, exchange semester in the Netherlands',
    'mp.fact7':            'Draughtswoman EFZ in architecture &ndash; five years of final artwork and dimensional accuracy',
