    'zff.role':            'Partnerships &amp; Events Manager &middot; Zurich Film Festival',
    'zff.both-kicker':     'Eleven days of festival.',
    'zff.both-title':      'Twelve months of partner.',
    'zff.both-l-label':    'What partners see in the autumn',
    'zff.both-l-text':     'The green carpet, the premiere, the lounge, the evening with guests. Eleven days on which every appearance has to land, because there is no second take.',
    'zff.both-r-label':    'What makes them renew in the spring',
    'zff.both-r-text':     'A report with numbers instead of impressions, a contact who is reachable all year, and an idea for the next edition before the contract runs out.',
    'zff.salutation':      'Dear Partnerships and Events team at the Zurich Film Festival',
    'zff.p1':              'The 22nd edition has just ended. For you, this is when the next edition gets decided: reports, conversations with partners, renewals. This is exactly the moment I want to get in touch.',
    'zff.p2':              'At TIT-PIT I am responsible for Migros&rsquo;s presence at more than ten of the biggest Swiss festivals &ndash; <strong>Frauenfeld</strong>, <strong>Pal&eacute;o</strong>, <strong>Moon &amp; Stars</strong>, <strong>Luzern Live</strong> &ndash; and this year also the <strong>Mocktail Bar Tour</strong> with twelve more dates. So I know the side you look after: the brand that wants to use a festival and, in the end, wants to know whether it paid off. I know what a partner asks in June, what makes them nervous on opening night and what they want to see in the report.',
    'zff.p3':              'The ZFF draws me because brands like UBS, Mercedes-Benz or Sunrise don&rsquo;t stand next to the programme here &ndash; they become part of the evening: on the carpet, in the cinema, at the after-party. That takes a light touch: the brand has to be visible without turning the film into a backdrop. That balance is what I look for in every activation.',
    'zff.p4':              'I no longer want to work at festivals only as an agency for one brand, but on the side of the festival itself &ndash; responsible for partnerships throughout the year, not just for single dates. Eleven intense days in the autumn don&rsquo;t put me off. I look forward to them.',
    'zff.closing':         'I look forward to telling you the rest in person.<br>Warm regards<br>Shayna Jucker',
    'zff.day-heading':     'a festival year',
    'zff.day-sub':         'How I run a partnership through the year',
    'zff.d1-time':         'JAN',
    'zff.d1-label':        'Report and renewal',
    'zff.d1-text':         'Prepare numbers, pictures and voices from last autumn &ndash; so the partner can argue internally why they should continue.',
    'zff.d2-time':         'MAR',
    'zff.d2-label':        'Build the package',
    'zff.d2-text':         'Bundle rights, spaces, tickets and hosting roles into an offer that fits the partner&rsquo;s goal, not just the price list.',
    'zff.d3-time':         'MAY',
    'zff.d3-label':        'Plan the activation',
    'zff.d3-text':         'Agree with the partner and their agency what happens on site, who is responsible for what and how success is measured.',
    'zff.d4-time':         'AUG',
    'zff.d4-label':        'Steer production',
    'zff.d4-text':         'Bring together schedules, suppliers, permits, guest lists and the content plan. Every open item has a name and a date.',
    'zff.d5-time':         'SEP',
    'zff.d5-label':        'Eleven days of festival',
    'zff.d5-text':         'Be there when it counts: carpet, premieres, partner events. Solve problems before the guests notice them.',
    'zff.d6-time':         'OCT',
    'zff.d6-label':        'Evaluate',
    'zff.d6-text':         'While memories are still fresh: collect the numbers, gather feedback, note the first idea for next year.',
    'zff.work-heading':    'work',
    'zff.work-sub':        'What I have done so far',
    'zff.work-p1':         'On my marketing page I show selected festival activations, tours and campaigns &ndash; with concept, execution and what came out of it.',
    'zff.work-btn1':       'View marketing cases',
    'zff.work-btn2':       'CV online',
    'zff.match-sub':       'What I bring to the role',
    'zff.m1-label':        'Knowing the partner side',
    'zff.m1-text':         'For two seasons I have been responsible for the festival presence of one of the biggest Swiss brands. I know what a partner needs to say yes internally.',
    'zff.m2-label':        'Looking after partners',
    'zff.m2-text':         'Weekly alignment with clients, organisers, authorities and suppliers. I am the person who is reachable and calls back.',
    'zff.m3-label':        'Proving impact',
    'zff.m3-text':         'Post-event reports with KPIs are standard for me. Every metric has a collection method and a target.',
    'zff.m4-label':        'Producing events',
    'zff.m4-text':         'From site plan to suppliers and crew to dismantling, I know every step first-hand &ndash; more than twenty dates a year.',
    'zff.m5-label':        'Being a host',
    'zff.m5-text':         'At partner events the first few minutes count. I stay calm when it gets hectic and friendly when it gets late.',
    'zff.m6-label':        'Content and design',
    'zff.m6-text':         'Photo, video, editing, graphics and copy I do myself. A partner deck or a mock-up for an idea doesn&rsquo;t need to be outsourced.',
    'zff.m7-label':        'German and English',
    'zff.m7-text':         'Both native, my mother is American. I can look after international guests, studios and distributors directly.',
    'zff.m8-label':        'A love of cinema',
    'zff.m8-text':         'A multimedia degree with film, editing and storytelling. I know how much work goes into a film &ndash; and why it has to stay at the centre.',
    'zff.fact1':           'Available from November 2026',
    'zff.fact2':           'Based in Pf&auml;ffikon ZH &ndash; about 30 minutes to Zurich',
    'zff.fact3':           'German and English native &ndash; French and Italian not at working level',
    'zff.fact4':           'No experience in the film industry &ndash; but two seasons on the partner side of the biggest Swiss festivals',
    'zff.fact5':           'Speculative application: I am applying for a role in partnerships or events, even if no position is advertised right now',
    'zff.fact6':           'BSc Multimedia Production FHGR, specialisation Live Communication, exchange semester in the Netherlands',
    'zff.fact7':           'Bachelor thesis: brand activism at ON, Nike and adidas',
    'zff.skills-sub':      'Partnerships &middot; Events &middot; Marketing &middot; Design &middot; Tools',
    'zff.heading':         'Letter of motivation',
