    'jl.role':             'Partnership Manager &middot; Just Live',
    'jl.both-kicker':      'I know your festivals.',
    'jl.both-title':       'From the partner area.',
    'jl.both-l-label':     'What the brand needs',
    'jl.both-l-text':      'A space that fits the audience, clear rights, reliable contacts on the organiser&rsquo;s side &ndash; and in the end numbers that convince internally.',
    'jl.both-r-label':     'What the festival can give',
    'jl.both-r-text':      'Audience, routes, timing, safety rules, neighbours on the site. I know what is possible on site before it goes into the offer.',
    'jl.salutation':       'Dear Just Live team',
    'jl.p1':               'I don&rsquo;t know Frauenfeld and Luzern Live from the crowd, but from the partner area. Over the last two summers I planned, built and evaluated Migros&rsquo;s presence there. You are on the other side of these partnerships &ndash; and that is exactly where I want to move.',
    'jl.p2':               'At TIT-PIT I am responsible for Migros&rsquo;s festival presence at more than ten Swiss festivals &ndash; <strong>Frauenfeld</strong>, <strong>Luzern Live</strong>, <strong>Pal&eacute;o</strong>, <strong>Gampel</strong>, <strong>Moon &amp; Stars</strong> &ndash; and this year also the <strong>Mocktail Bar Tour</strong> with twelve more dates. With the client I set goals, budget and KPIs; with organisers, spaces, rights and schedules. So I know what a brand asks before it signs, and what it wants to see in the report before it renews.',
    'jl.p3':               'You draw me because you work right between these worlds: you translate a festival into an offer a brand understands, and a brand into an activation the audience enjoys. With formats like Old But Gold in Zurich you also show that you don&rsquo;t just sell, you build events yourselves. That mix of sales, consulting and delivery is what I do best.',
    'jl.p4':               'I bring what convinces in a sales conversation with a brand: I can say from my own experience what works at a festival and what doesn&rsquo;t. And I deliver what is in the offer &ndash; because I know how much work is behind it.',
    'jl.closing':          'I look forward to telling you the rest in person.<br>Warm regards<br>Shayna Jucker',
    'jl.day-heading':      'from festival to partner',
    'jl.day-sub':          'How I sell and look after a partnership',
    'jl.d1-time':          '01',
    'jl.d1-label':         'Understand the platform',
    'jl.d1-text':          'Know the festival&rsquo;s audience, site, rights and inventory &ndash; not from the brochure, but from walking the site.',
    'jl.d2-time':          '02',
    'jl.d2-label':         'Find the right brand',
    'jl.d2-text':          'Which brand has a goal this audience can meet? A good offer starts with the brand&rsquo;s question, not the price list.',
    'jl.d3-time':          '03',
    'jl.d3-label':         'Build the offer',
    'jl.d3-text':          'Bundle rights, spaces and activation ideas into a package &ndash; in two variants, with clear KPIs and the difference between them.',
    'jl.d4-time':          '04',
    'jl.d4-label':         'Close',
    'jl.d4-text':          'Negotiate without overselling. What is in the contract, the festival must be able to deliver.',
    'jl.d5-time':          '05',
    'jl.d5-label':         'Accompany delivery',
    'jl.d5-text':          'Mediate between brand, agency and organiser so the activation on site keeps the promise of the offer.',
    'jl.d6-time':          '06',
    'jl.d6-label':         'Renew',
    'jl.d6-text':          'With a report that shows what it achieved &ndash; and an idea for next year.',
    'jl.work-heading':     'work',
    'jl.work-sub':         'What I have done so far',
    'jl.work-p1':          'On my marketing page I show selected festival activations, tours and campaigns &ndash; with concept, execution and what came out of it.',
    'jl.work-btn1':        'View marketing cases',
    'jl.work-btn2':        'CV online',
    'jl.match-sub':        'What I bring to the role',
    'jl.m1-label':         'Your festivals from the inside',
    'jl.m1-text':          'I know Frauenfeld and Luzern Live from planning and build-up: routes, spaces, schedules and the people who work there.',
    'jl.m2-label':         'The brand&rsquo;s view',
    'jl.m2-text':          'For two seasons I worked on the side of a big brand. I know how decisions are made there and what an offer has to answer.',
    'jl.m3-label':         'Advising and selling',
    'jl.m3-text':          'Quotes, concepts and budget variants for clients are part of my everyday work. I go into budget talks with two variants, not an opinion.',
    'jl.m4-label':         'Proving impact',
    'jl.m4-text':          'Post-event reports with KPIs for clients are standard for me. Every metric has a collection method and a target.',
    'jl.m5-label':         'Knowing delivery',
    'jl.m5-text':          'More than twenty dates a year, from site plan to dismantling. I see early where a concept breaks on site.',
